'''Branches''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 10th tier in the Main Event during the [[Halloween Event 2019|2019 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Its silver blade is entwined in what appears to be dark brown tree branches, hence the name. The guard and handle also are a dark brown with a wood-like texture to it.  

==Trivia==
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]]. {{UncommonsNav}}

